<!doctype html>
<html lang="zh-CN"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=1080,height=1920"><title>把选择演出来 · 连续语义编排实测</title>
<link rel="stylesheet" href="assets/composition.css"><script src="assets/gsap.min.js"></script><script src="assets/timing.js"></script></head>
<body><main id="root" data-composition-id="main" data-width="1080" data-height="1920" data-fps="30" data-duration="21.3">
<div class="background"></div>
<header class="masthead"><span>普通人的财经底线</span><span class="edition">选择，先看清楚</span></header>
<nav class="steps"><div id="step-1"><i>01</i><span>少冲动</span></div><div id="step-2"><i>02</i><span>守本金</span></div><div id="step-3"><i>03</i><span>减负债</span></div></nav>
<section id="heading"><p id="eyebrow">第一条 / 消费选择</p><h1 id="headline">砍掉无效消费</h1><p id="subhead">下单之前，给判断留一步。</p></section>

<div id="receipt-outline"><span class="surface-label">生活物品 · 用途示意</span><div class="receipt-rule"></div></div>
<div id="classification"><div class="class-col"><b>想要</b><span>例如：已有同类</span></div><div class="class-col"><b>需要</b><span>例如：确有用途</span></div><div class="class-divider"></div><p>分类取决于实际用途</p></div>
<div class="photo" id="photo-0"><div class="photo-crop"><img id="product-headphone" data-layout-allow-overflow src="assets/life-objects.png" alt="耳机示意"></div></div>
<div class="photo" id="photo-1"><div class="photo-crop"><img id="product-shoes" data-layout-allow-overflow src="assets/life-objects.png" alt="鞋子示意"></div></div>
<div class="photo" id="photo-2"><div class="photo-crop"><img id="product-grocery" data-layout-allow-overflow src="assets/life-objects.png" alt="日用采购示意"></div></div>
<div class="photo" id="photo-3"><div class="photo-crop"><img id="product-household" data-layout-allow-overflow src="assets/life-objects.png" alt="日用品示意"></div></div>
<div id="impulse-strip"><span>冲动加购</span><svg viewBox="0 0 420 100"><path id="cut-line" d="M26 78 L394 22"/></svg></div>
<div id="checkout-gate"><span class="pause-sign"><i></i><i></i></span><b>先停一下</b><span class="gate-stop"></span></div>
<div id="spend-memory">01 / 少冲动</div>
<div id="budget-label">自己的钱 · 示意</div>

<div id="capital-frame"><div class="capital-topline"><span>自己的钱</span><svg viewBox="0 0 36 40"><path d="M9 18 V11 a9 9 0 0 1 18 0 v7 M6 18h24v20H6z"/></svg></div><div class="capital-base"></div></div>
<div id="capital-label">本金</div><div id="capital-note">先守住，再做选择</div>
<div id="coins"></div>
<div id="pitch-surface" data-layout-allow-overlap data-layout-allow-occlusion><div class="risk-back"><small>翻开说法，看里面</small><b>暗藏风险</b><div class="risk-mark">!</div></div><div id="pitch-front"><small>夸大说法 · 示意</small><b>高收益</b><span class="fold-tab">往下看</span></div></div>
<div id="risk-underline"></div><div id="protect-rail"></div>
<div class="speculation" id="speculation-left"><small>保持距离</small><b>投机</b></div><div class="speculation" id="speculation-right"><small>保持距离</small><b>炒作</b></div>

<div id="debt-group"><p>负债负担 · 示意</p><div id="debt-blocks"></div></div>
<svg id="pressure-left" viewBox="0 0 60 320"><path d="M52 8 H12 V312 H52"/></svg><svg id="pressure-right" viewBox="0 0 60 320"><path d="M8 8 H48 V312 H8"/></svg>
<div id="debt-note">给生活，留出余地</div>

<div id="recap-panels"><div><span>01</span><b>少冲动</b></div><div><span>02</span><b>守本金</b></div><div><span>03</span><b>减负债</b></div></div>
<div id="presenter-shell"><div id="presenter-mask"><video id="presenter" class="clip" src="assets/master.mp4" data-start="0" data-duration="21.3" data-media-start="15.366666666666667" data-track-index="0" data-has-audio="false" muted playsinline></video></div></div>
<div id="captions"><p id="caption-text">第一，砍掉无效消费</p></div>
<footer id="credit">物品为 AI 生成示意 · 图解不代表真实金额</footer><div id="progress"></div>
<audio id="voice" src="assets/edited-voice.wav" data-start="0" data-duration="21.3" data-track-index="1"></audio>
</main><script src="assets/motion.js"></script></body></html>
